<article class="env-lemma" id="0G79">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0G79">Lemma <span data-tag="0G79">20.34.13</span>.</a> With notation and assumptions as in Remark <a href="/tag/0G78" data-tag="0G78">20.34.12</a> the diagram </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ H^ p_ Z(X, K) \ar[r] \ar[d] &  H^ p_{Z'}(X', Lf^*K) \ar[d] \\  H^ p(X, K) \ar[r] &  H^ p(X', Lf^*K) }  \]
</div>
  <p> commutes. Here the top horizontal arrow comes from the identifications $H^ p_ Z(X, K) = H^ p(Z, R\mathcal{H}_ Z(K))$ and $H^ p_{Z'}(X', Lf^*K) = H^ p(Z', R\mathcal{H}_{Z'}(K'))$, the pullback map $H^ p(Z, R\mathcal{H}_ Z(K)) \to H^ p(Z', L(f|_{Z'})^*R\mathcal{H}_ Z(K))$, and the map constructed in Remark <a href="/tag/0G78" data-tag="0G78">20.34.12</a>. </p>
</article> 
